 "sentences": [
  "A parasite can slowly crawl out of you.",
  "Guinea-worm disease starts by drinking water contaminated with tiny larvae.",
  "After a year, a female worm creates a painful blister on your skin.",
  "When the blister bursts, the worm slowly emerges over several weeks.",
  "There is no medication to treat or prevent this infection.",
  "Instead, you must carefully wrap the worm around a stick to pull it out."
